      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077335.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56749201803583d72fb061b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很遗憾，成田路她们谁都没赢，\n但是比赛本身依然极具看点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9067eea2e60abdb4f90057aef54ebacc1fbffd1e12ee0f020410d9757d2f2acb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077335.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af4c7eddbf86bf44482e769",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样比赛结束后，\n四人一起聚集在地下通道中――",
      "source_fingerprint": "e42ca6c56358903ad6aa2195e3888ecf834690d958b3bc4636dba711358f5b47",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077335.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6dc2ae59049a945d3c2a15e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田路",
